## 🎟 Ticketing System

**The model:**

- DJ sets ticket price per event (can be $0 for free events)
- Platform takes % fee at Stripe processing
- Ticket purchase unlocks zone audio at entry time
- Geofence = ticket validation — if you’re inside the zone and have a ticket, audio plays

**What needs to be built:**

### Stripe Setup

- [ ] Stripe Connect — DJs create their own payout accounts
- [ ] Platform fee configured as Stripe application fee
- [ ] Monthly dues for Carnival Society membership (recurring subscription)
- [ ] Ticket purchase flow (one-time payment per event)

### Database — New Tables Needed

```sql
tickets
  id, event_id, user_id, price_paid, 
  stripe_payment_id, status, created_at

profiles (extend existing)
  society_member boolean
  society_chapter (denver | boulder | la)
  society_role (member | organizer | dj)
  stripe_account_id
  stripe_customer_id
  bio, avatar_emoji, instagram

follows
  follower_id, following_id, type (dj | group)

groups
  id, name, bio, chapter, created_by, members[]
```

### Zone Entry Ticket Check

When listener enters geofence → check `tickets` table for valid ticket → if found, unlock audio. If not, show purchase flow.

